		"Details": "The 8V variant of the Longbow was an inevitability, as it finally swaps the Longbow's Long-Range Missiles for true artillery weapons, specifically a pair of Arrow IV launchers, one each to an arm. For backup firepower, the LGB-8V carries an ER Large Laser and twin Medium Pulse Lasers, though its chances of survival when confronted at close range are admittedly poor. Longbow pilots are well advised to keep their distance from the enemy and just let the Arrows do the talking.",
